{
  "format": "tap-agent-api-coverage/1",
  "note": "Covered means a practical SDK-backed tool, not identical signatures or raw RPC access. SDK helper aliases are grouped. Empty tool lists require an explicit client-only/deferred reason.",
  "rpcs": {
    "tap.v1.ClientConnectionService": {
      "Connect": ["attach"], "Disconnect": ["release"], "Info": ["server_info"], "ListConnections": ["sessions", "devices"], "Events": ["history"]
    },
    "tap.v1.DeviceService": {
      "ListDevices": ["devices"], "Unquarantine": ["unquarantine"], "Attach": ["attach"], "Detach": ["detach"], "Execute": ["tap"],
      "Screenshot": ["screenshot"], "DriverLog": ["logs", "capture"], "DeviceLogs": ["logs"],
      "StartRecording": ["media_record"], "StopRecording": ["media_record"],
      "ScreenSnapshot": ["snapshot", "settle"], "ResolveRef": ["tap"],
      "SetAnimations": ["condition"], "SetDarkMode": ["condition"], "SetFontScale": ["condition"], "SetDensity": ["condition"], "SetNetwork": ["condition"], "SetSystemLocales": ["condition"], "SetLocation": ["set_location"], "SetStayAwake": ["condition"], "SetAccessibilityDisplay": ["condition"],
      "GetForegroundActivity": ["foreground_activity"], "PushFile": ["push_file"], "PullFile": ["pull_file"], "AddMedia": ["add_media"]
    },
    "tap.v1.AppService": {
      "Install": ["app"], "Uninstall": ["app"], "IsInstalled": ["app"], "ForceStop": ["app"], "ClearData": ["app"], "GrantPermission": ["app"], "RevokePermission": ["app"], "IsPermissionGranted": ["app"], "SetLocales": ["app"], "GetLocales": ["app"], "Launch": ["app"], "ColdLaunch": ["app"], "Foreground": ["app"], "OpenLink": ["app"], "Process": ["app"], "IsRunning": ["app"]
    },
    "tap.v1.AppDataService": {
      "GetCapabilities": ["app_data"], "ListFiles": ["app_data"], "ReadFile": ["app_data"], "WriteFile": ["app_data"], "DeleteFile": ["app_data"], "ExportDatabase": ["app_data"], "ImportDatabase": ["app_data"]
    }
  },
  "excluded_rpcs": {
    "tap.v1.ClientConnectionService.Observe": "Observed test-client liveness is infrastructure; agents use held connections.",
    "tap.v1.AppService.AwaitIdle": "Synchronization is work in progress and intentionally deferred; state/tree/pixel waits are independent.",
    "tap.v1.WatchService.Watch": "Passive shared observation belongs to tap-watcher, not an agent-owned recording.",
    "tap.v1.WatchService.WatchVideo": "Passive shared observation belongs to tap-watcher, not an agent-owned recording."
  },
  "operations": {
    "device_info": ["device_info", "condition"], "press_key": ["press_key"], "dump_hierarchy": ["logs", "capture"],
    "exists": ["exists", "scroll_until"], "count": ["count", "wait_for"], "snapshot": ["inspect", "wait_for", "accessibility_action"],
    "wait_visible": ["wait_for"], "wait_gone": ["wait_for"], "wait_state": ["wait_for"], "wait_app_visible": ["app"], "wait_screen_stable": ["settle"],
    "tap": ["tap", "type_text"], "long_tap": ["tap"], "double_tap": ["tap"], "multi_tap": ["tap"], "hold": ["tap"],
    "set_text": ["fill"], "type_text": ["type_text"], "clear_text": ["clear"], "swipe": ["swipe"], "scroll": ["scroll", "scroll_until"], "drag": ["drag"], "pinch": ["pinch"], "fling": ["fling"],
    "open_system_panel": ["open_panel"], "set_orientation": ["rotate"], "set_display_rotation": ["rotate"], "unfreeze_rotation": ["rotate"], "dismiss_keyguard": ["screen"],
    "wait_permission_prompt": ["permission"], "choose_permission": ["permission"], "hide_keyboard": ["keyboard"], "perform_ime_action": ["submit"],
    "set_clipboard": ["clipboard"], "get_clipboard": ["clipboard"], "await_toast": ["await_toast"], "perform_accessibility_action": ["accessibility_action"], "set_progress": ["set_progress"], "set_location": ["set_location"],
    "await_notification": ["notification"], "list_notifications": ["notification"], "open_notification": ["notification"], "dismiss_notification": ["notification"]
  },
  "sdk": {
    "TapClient": [
      {"methods": ["info", "devices", "unquarantine", "connect", "connections"], "tools": ["server_info", "devices", "unquarantine", "attach", "sessions"], "reason": "connect uses held mode only"},
      {"methods": ["create", "resume", "close"], "tools": [], "reason": "Client transport/handle lifecycle; Agent constructs and closes its SDK client, never starts a daemon."}
    ],
    "TapConnection": [
      {"methods": ["attach_device", "attached_devices", "close", "event_log", "events"], "tools": ["attach", "sessions", "release", "history"]},
      {"methods": ["ensure_usable", "available_serials", "broken", "usable"], "tools": [], "reason": "Client usability/filtering helpers; devices exposes inventory, no raw connection escape hatch."}
    ],
    "App": [
      {"methods": ["element", "wait", "is_installed", "install", "uninstall", "force_stop", "clear_data", "grant_permission", "is_permission_granted", "set_locales", "locales", "revoke_permission", "launch", "await_visible", "foreground", "background", "open_link", "cold_launch", "process", "is_running"], "tools": ["app", "tap", "wait_for"]},
      {"methods": ["await_toast", "await_notification"], "tools": ["await_toast", "notification"], "reason": "Package filter supplies app scope."},
      {"methods": ["await_screen_stable", "await_settled", "await_animation_end"], "tools": ["settle"], "reason": "tree/pixels/all and explicit package preserve SDK shorthands."},
      {"methods": ["await_idle"], "tools": [], "reason": "Synchronization is intentionally deferred."}
    ],
    "AppData": [
      {"methods": ["capabilities", "list", "read", "write", "delete", "export_database", "import_database"], "tools": ["app_data"]}
    ],
    "Device": [
      {"methods": ["app", "info", "press_back", "press_home", "press_key", "open_notifications", "open_quick_settings", "set_orientation", "set_display_rotation", "unfreeze_rotation", "wake", "sleep", "dismiss_keyguard"], "tools": ["app", "device_info", "press_key", "open_panel", "rotate", "screen"]},
      {"methods": ["await_permission_prompt", "choose_permission", "keyboard_shown", "hide_keyboard", "set_clipboard", "clipboard"], "tools": ["permission", "keyboard", "clipboard"]},
      {"methods": ["set_animations", "set_dark_mode", "set_font_scale", "set_density", "set_network", "set_system_locales", "set_stay_awake", "set_accessibility_display", "set_location"], "tools": ["condition", "set_location"]},
      {"methods": ["foreground_activity", "push_file", "pull_file", "add_media", "await_toast", "await_notification", "notifications", "open_notification", "dismiss_notification", "type_text"], "tools": ["foreground_activity", "push_file", "pull_file", "add_media", "await_toast", "notification", "type_text"]},
      {"methods": ["screenshot", "start_recording", "stop_recording", "dump_hierarchy", "screen_snapshot", "resolve_ref", "driver_log", "device_logs", "capture", "detach"], "tools": ["screenshot", "media_record", "logs", "snapshot", "capture", "detach", "tap"]},
      {"methods": ["await_until", "detached"], "tools": [], "reason": "Local handle state and arbitrary Python predicates remain client-side; use held-session inventory and bounded waits, not user-code execution."}
    ],
    "Element": [
      {"methods": ["exists", "count", "snapshot", "text", "is_enabled", "is_checked"], "tools": ["exists", "count", "inspect"]},
      {"methods": ["tap", "triple_tap", "long_tap", "double_tap", "ime_action", "perform_action", "perform_custom_action", "set_progress", "drag_to", "pinch_open", "pinch_close", "fling", "set_text", "type_text", "clear_text", "swipe", "scroll", "scroll_until"], "tools": ["tap", "submit", "accessibility_action", "set_progress", "drag", "pinch", "fling", "fill", "type_text", "clear", "swipe", "scroll", "scroll_until"]},
      {"methods": ["wait", "descendant", "child", "first", "at"], "tools": ["wait_for", "tap"], "reason": "Targets support equivalent relational JSON and explicit first/index."}
    ],
    "ElementWait": [
      {"methods": ["visible", "one", "gone", "enabled", "disabled", "checked", "unchecked", "focused", "text_equals", "text_contains", "count"], "tools": ["wait_for"]},
      {"methods": ["until"], "tools": [], "reason": "a general condition is not a wait_for state yet; --state covers the shortcuts"}
    ],
    "Screen": [
      {"methods": ["element", "wait"], "tools": ["tap", "wait_for"], "reason": "Whole-screen default, no implicit app scope."}
    ],
    "Selector": [
      {"methods": ["and_text", "and_desc", "and_class_name", "and_hint", "and_res", "checkable", "checked", "clickable", "enabled", "focusable", "focused", "long_clickable", "scrollable", "selected", "has_descendant", "has_child", "has_parent", "has_ancestor", "descendant", "child", "first", "at"], "tools": ["tap"], "reason": "Shared bounded target grammar for all selector-taking tools; logical/relational forms and match modes."},
      {"methods": ["from_proto", "to_proto", "render"], "tools": [], "reason": "Representation helpers, not an agent-facing raw protobuf API."}
    ]
  },
  "cli_field_aliases": {
    "*": {"timeout": "timeout_seconds", "focus_timeout": "focus_timeout_seconds", "idle": "idle_minutes", "wait_for_device": "wait_for_device_seconds", "level": "view", "accuracy": "accuracy_m", "altitude": "altitude_m", "local": "local_path", "out": "path", "extra": "extras"},
    "tap": {"timeout": "timeout"}, "permission": {"accuracy": "accuracy"}, "pull": {"out": "out"}, "app-data": {"local": "local"}, "key": {"name": "key"}, "panel": {"name": "panel"}
  },
  "cli_only_fields": {"devices": ["session"], "unquarantine": ["session"], "sessions": ["session"], "server-info": ["session"]},
  "limitations": [
    "The Kotlin SDK mirrors these protocol-backed capabilities; its coroutine/test-run utilities and model/artifact helpers are not tool endpoints. Reflection tests cover the operational Python classes named above, not all SDK modules.",
    "Parameter-name parity does not prove value semantics: CLI durations use units, MCP uses seconds/minutes; absent optional strings normalize to None. Tests cover forwarded fields, limits and effects.",
    "Targeted typing is SDK tap/focus-wait/type, not one atomic command. Input timeout is per step; focus_timeout sets its separate wait, not IME readiness. Observe app/keyboard state explicitly as needed. There is no automatic replay or rollback.",
    "State/count waits use SDK host polling; visible/gone/one and app/tree/pixel waits keep their existing SDK behavior, not synchronization.",
    "Lifecycle commands expose timeout only where the SDK has an explicit parameter. Uninstall, permissions, locale and other fixed-budget SDK calls retain those budgets; unsupported app timeout arguments fail locally.",
    "Scroll-until bounds iterations and time, not end-of-list detection. Input acceptance does not prove an app-specific effect.",
    "Media recordings use the existing host scrcpy capture, API/timing limits and checksum verification; no implicit app lifecycle. Start readiness and recorder shutdown-budget limits remain deferred. Stop saves privately before an optional custom copy; local errors never trigger replay.",
    "No arbitrary shell, SQL, root, coordinates, XPath, persistent node handles or raw Execute RPC. Agent sessions are held, never observed. Watcher internals and awaitIdle remain excluded."
  ]
}
